h&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2B6CB0;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c16"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="180.0" width="210.0" height="42.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Telemedicine-Prod&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;AKS · APIM · ACS&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D9822B;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c22"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="30.0" width="180.0" height="42.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Patient-Portal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;web &amp;amp; mobile back end&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D9822B;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c22"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="80.0" width="180.0" height="42.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Telemedicine-NonProd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;synthetic data only&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D9822B;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c22"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="130.0" width="180.0" height="42.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;TRE-Core&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;airlock, catalog, broker&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1E8C7E;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c27"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="30.0" width="180.0" height="42.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;TRE-Workspaces&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;per-project subscriptions&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1E8C7E;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c27"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="80.0" width="180.0" height="42.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Research-EU&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;West Europe datasets&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1E8C7E;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c27"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="130.0" width="180.0" height="42.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Corp-Apps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;line-of-business apps&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#718096;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c32"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="30.0" width="250.0" height="42.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Arc-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;on-prem servers &amp;amp; Azure Local&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#718096;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c32"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="80.0" width="250.0" height="42.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Intermediate-root policies (inherited everywhere): allowed regions (East US 2, Central US; West Europe for EU datasets) · customer-managed keys for PHI-tagged data · TLS ≥ 1.2 · diagnostics to central Log Analytics · Defender for Cloud plans on · mandatory tags (owner, data-class, criticality)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9.6;fontColor=#2D3748;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="86.0" width="400.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Deny: user-defined routes bypassing the firewall · only platform engineers via PIM" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9.2;fontColor=#4A5568;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="c7"><mxGeometry x="12.0" y="296.0" width="216.0" height="50.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="Deny public endpoints &amp;amp; public IPs · Private Link only · HIPAA/HITRUST initiative (audit) · Defender for Servers P2, SQL, Storage" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=8.9;fontColor=#4A5568;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="c16"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="234.0" width="210.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="Ingress only via Front Door + WAF → APIM · DDoS Network Protection · Defender for Containers &amp;amp; APIs" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=8.9;fontColor=#4A5568;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="c22"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="184.0" width="180.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="No internet egress · confidential-compute SKUs · export only through airlock" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=8.9;fontC